    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "LIOL-6 01\n9900-931\nL784-\nThank You..\nWe appreciate your patronage. We are con-\ntinually striving to better our service to make\nyour trip more enjoyable. Any suggestion you\nmay have will be greatly appreciated.\nPacific Southwest Airlines",
      "Daily Flights..\nDAILY\nexcept Saturday\nNORTHBOUND\nLv. SAN DIEGO\nAr. BURBANK\nLv. BURBANK\nAr. OAKLAND\nSOUTHBOUND\nLv. OAKLAND\nAr. BURBANK\nLv. BURBANK\nAr. SAN DIEGO\nFLT. 101\nFLT. 201\n8:40*\n5:20\n9:30%\n6:10\n9:45%\n6:25\n11:45%\n8:25\nFLT. 102\nFLT. 202\n12:45\n8:55\n2:45\n10:55\n3:15\n11:10\n4:05\n11:55\nEffective July 27, 1949\nSATURDAY\nONLY\nFLT. 121\n1:30\n2:20\n2:35\n4:35\nFLT. 122\n6:45\n8:45\n9:00\n9:50\n*Light face means a.m. - Bold face means p.m.\nNew Low Fares..\nSan Diego to Burbank\n565\nPlus\nTax\nSan Diego to San Francisco Bay Area 1560\nPlus\nTax\nBurbank to San Francisco Bay Area.. 995\nPlus\nTax"
